  "raceTraits": {
    "Celestial Resistance": "You have Resistance to Necrotic damage and Radiant damage.",
    "Healing Hands": "As a Magic action, touch a creature and roll a number of d4s equal to your Proficiency Bonus. The creature regains Hit Points equal to the total. Once per Long Rest.",
    "Light Bearer": "You know the Light cantrip, using Charisma as your spellcasting ability for it.",
    "Celestial Revelation": "From character level 3, take a Bonus Action to transform for 1 minute or until you end it (no action required). Choose an option each time. While transformed, once on each of your turns you can deal extra damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus to one target you damage with an attack or a spell; it is Necrotic for Necrotic Shroud and Radiant otherwise. Heavenly Wings: you gain a Fly Speed equal to your Speed. Inner Radiance: you shed Bright Light in a {{distance:10ft|adj}} radius and Dim Light for {{distance:10ft}} more, and at the end of each of your turns every other creature within {{distance:10ft}} takes Radiant damage equal to your Proficiency Bonus. Necrotic Shroud: when you transform, creatures other than your allies within {{distance:10ft}} succeed on a Charisma save (DC 8 + your Charisma modifier + Proficiency Bonus) or have the Frightened condition until the end of your next turn. Once per Long Rest."
  },
